posts.text:
This is only made funnier by the fact that there was absolutely no contract clause preventing me from asking questions or any contract clause which allowed him to pepper me with questions uninterrupted. He just randomly crashed out and made that up. 😂

I sensed he was emotional so I just allowed it. I’m just a nice girl. 

@IanCarrollShow

Did you drop the actual text message on your show, as promised?
You premiered a “never before seen text message” from Charlie but we noticed that it remains “never before seen”. 

@AndrewKolvet @MrsErikaKirk  strange way to premiere it but we are all looking forward to seeing it!

